Package: TRSC
Type: Package
Title: Temporally Regularized Synthetic Controls
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Onur", "Düzgün",
           email = "77804721+oduzgun@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Research software for temporally regularized synthetic-control
    predictive relationships. The package treats predictive profiles as the
    primary fitted object and allows singular predictive geometry and
    nonunique donor-coordinate representations. The current development
    version provides data preparation, chronological splitting, empirical
    predictive geometry, a representation-aware pre-treatment fitting layer,
    theorem-aligned calibration/fitting/validation sample roles, terminal
    convex readouts, frozen cutoff-targeted candidate selection, and explicit
    dependent-panel coupling diagnostics. Post-treatment causal identification
    is not yet part of the stable API.
